## 7. Important distinction: brands are not product categories

Do not confuse a product brand with a product category or product type.

Examples:

Product categories/types:
- ყურსასმენები
- დამტენები
- კაბელები
- კლავიატურები
- მაუსები
- სმარტფონები

Brands:
- Hoco
- Borofone
- Marshall
- Samsung
- Apple
- Xiaomi
- JBL
- Baseus
- Anker

A brand can contain many different product types.

For example, Hoco can have:
- Headphones.
- Chargers.
- Cables.
- Speakers.
- Other accessories.

All Hoco products must be discoverable under the Hoco brand, regardless of their category.

Do not create a new product category called Hoco.

Implement a separate canonical brand system.

## 8. Dynamic brand data source

Inspect the existing brand model and product schema.

If a suitable brand collection already exists, reuse it.

Otherwise, implement a canonical Firestore brand collection using the existing architecture.

